cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "APSRAI Prototype: Human-in-the-Loop Governance for Agentic AI Threat Detection"
abstract: >-
  A Python proof-of-concept of the APSRAI framework (Agentic Public Sector
  Resilience AI): a four-stage gated pipeline that makes a human operator
  structurally mandatory before any consequential action in an AI-driven
  threat-detection workflow, with a tamper-evident hash-chained audit log.
  Developed as the demonstration and artifact components of a Design Science
  Research study on operationalizing EU AI Act human-oversight requirements
  for critical infrastructure.
authors:
